    4. Client Assessment (CA) Model




                                                             型
     Illegal wildlife trade is a global problem. That is why choosing the right client to
implement a project is crucial to significantly reducing illegal wildlife trade. There are a




                                                           模
variety of instruments and policies that can be used to reduce illegal wildlife, involving
different subjects.
     Here, we have developed a system of indicators to measure the impact of different




                                                          学
clients on reducing illegal wildlife trade. In order to obtain the best results, we evaluated
clients comprehensively in four aspects: power, resources, interest and influence, and for each
aspect, we selected two to three indicators with high impact, obtaining a total of 12 indicators.




                                                        数
Second, we combined the analytic hierarchy process (AHP) and entropy weight method
(EWM) to determine the weight of each indicator. Finally, based on the modified TOPSIS
method we established our client evaluation model.   ：
