    6. Stop Illegal Wildlife Trade (SIWT) Model
  微




      We chose WWF as the client of our project, and this section will then describe the
specific content of the project in detail. We start from the links of the industrial chain of
illegal wildlife trade and divide the whole project into four mini-models.




