       6.2.2 Strategy II: Reducing poaching behavior
    In our SPW model, the values of r1 , r2 ,  1 and  2 are also affected by many factors.
When the government's efforts to combat illegal poaching increase, the value of 1 will rise.
 (t ) is a function of time, and its value reflects market demand. The following are our
proposed strategies for combating illegal poaching.

