      6.3    Forecasting Illegal Wildlife Trade（FIWT） Model
        6.3.1 FIWT Model




                                                     数
      The FIWT model is used to predict the number of wildlife that can be illegally traded in
the market each month. The number of wildlife that can be illegally traded each month
consists of the number of wildlife that was not sold in the previous month and the number of
                                                  ：
wildlife that was illegally poached this month. Above we have fitted the number of illegally




                                                 els
poached wildlife in each month through the SPW model, so we predict the number of
illegally tradable wildlife in each period in the form of a difference equation. The FIWT
                          号
model has seven variables, two coefficients, and four constants. The following are specific



                                               od
explanations:
