      8.3    Likelihood that the Project will Meet its Objectives
                          号
     Moving forward with the set five-year plan, we can achieve a 52.4 per cent reduction in


                                               od
the amount of illegally traded wildlife and a 9.3 per cent increase in the number of wild
                         众


animals.
     However, the project is subject to a number of destabilizing factors. As shown in Figure
